algorithm.detail:
Identify which single course concept the statement tests (CIA property, firewall type, IDS class, design principle, authentication factor, salt purpose, DoS mechanism, etc.) and restate the exact assertion it makes:
\begin{tightitem}
\item a \term{definition} or claimed \term{equivalence} (``synonym''),
\item a \term{mechanism} attributed to a tool or attack,
\item a bad practice attributed to a \term{named principle}.
\end{tightitem}
